@title Wire numbering: nets on a revision-locked page are left alone
@area Schematic
# Place a circuit (its wires have no number yet), issue a revision with the default page lock,
# then open Wire numbering: the Numbers tab marks the nets "page locked (A)" and the preview
# says they are left alone.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "motor starter dol"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Motor starter DOL" Label
wait 10
click_text Place Button #2
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text issue First issue
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Issue A" Button
wait 20
expect "Page locked (A)"
key ctrl+k
text "wire numbering"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
expect "page locked (A)"
shot numbers-locked
click_text Preview Button
wait 5
expect "locked pages left alone"
shot preview-locked
